body:
1. Sets up the Quarkus augmentation classloader to pick up `kecloak-builder/application.properties` as application properties for the Keycloak instance being built;
2. Isolates the Quarkus bootstrap classpath based on the Quarkus version the target Keycloak server was built with from the `keycloak-builder`'s Quarkus bootstrap classes (`quarkus-bootstrap-maven-resolver` and `quarkus-bootstra-app-model` versions are temporarily enforced to `2.13.3.Final`);
3. Make sure the script files under the created `bin` dir are executable;
4. Changed the default dist dir from `target/keycloak` to `keycloak`.
